{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/4992ee1308cfe2439e0648646eeb148c.avif?t=1754046027\" /></div>The King of Garnoc died without an heir. Lords are fighting for the throne. Create your own unique deck of cards and units, battle tough lords and become the king!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the conquest of 2 regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/175af788e8ed442a0a7ca54a8ef25e13.poster.avif?t=1754046027\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/175af788e8ed442a0a7ca54a8ef25e13.webm?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/175af788e8ed442a0a7ca54a8ef25e13.mp4?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your card deck and build your army. Each card is triggered by a unit's class, strength or type. You must have the suitable units to play the cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/d2a222443b6a7dee93d317b86dc39cdf.avif?t=1754046027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards can be upgraded in two ways. Card Level increases the damage dealt by the card, while Position Level allows the card to target multiple enemies at once. Upgrading cards is crucial to survive. A well-upgraded deck can make the difference between victory and defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/2c7df83ed647483544630a9b9bc6d014.poster.avif?t=1754046027\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/2c7df83ed647483544630a9b9bc6d014.webm?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/2c7df83ed647483544630a9b9bc6d014.mp4?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cards can be upgraded at the blacksmith after battles, when you find treasure or during special events. Choosing the right time to strengthen your cards gives you an advantage in every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/941b814a86be7b65acec8ca40c133e62.avif?t=1754046027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Molgrad... It was once a magnificent empire. However, when and how it fell is not even recorded in history books. Though the Molgrad Empire has vanished from the stage of history, it left behind legendary legacies that still maintain their power. These Imperial legacies can significantly strengthen your deck through their powerful effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.poster.avif?t=1754046027\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.webm?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.mp4?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the fall of the Molgrad Empire, its lands were divided into many small kingdoms. The legendary legacies of the Empire are hidden within these kingdoms. According to legends, the one who unites these legacies will restore the shattered Molgrad Empire to its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/8c87ffa210f31eeef5160cde53e86264.avif?t=1754046027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each card affects enemies in specific positions. With certain special cards, you can randomly or selectively change the enemy's formation. This mechanic adds strategic depth to battles and allows you to make advantageous attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/ffc3d9a6c19026727db605a01a9070e4.poster.avif?t=1754046027\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/ffc3d9a6c19026727db605a01a9070e4.webm?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/ffc3d9a6c19026727db605a01a9070e4.mp4?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you only have cards that work with specific units and you don\u2019t have those units in your hand, some special cards allow you to swap your units and rebuilding the strategic balance. When used at the right moment, it can change the destiny of the battle.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723700?t=1754046027","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/f23b9a868e5c1b228bf11fc0e938d9b8864ea03c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754046027","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/f32c9c1976dbe304e4e8362f612e9f034f91ccfc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754046027","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/f32c9c1976dbe304e4e8362f612e9f034f91ccfc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754046027","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/4992ee1308cfe2439e0648646eeb148c.avif?t=1754046027\" /></div>The King of Garnoc died without an heir. Lords are fighting for the throne. Create your own unique deck of cards and units, battle tough lords and become the king!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo includes the conquest of 2 regions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/175af788e8ed442a0a7ca54a8ef25e13.poster.avif?t=1754046027\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/175af788e8ed442a0a7ca54a8ef25e13.webm?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/175af788e8ed442a0a7ca54a8ef25e13.mp4?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create your card deck and build your army. Each card is triggered by a unit's class, strength or type. You must have the suitable units to play the cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/d2a22244