/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.poster.avif?t=1754046027\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.webm?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/f94fddaae841e9840248e32bca367a7a.mp4?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With the fall of the Molgrad Empire, its lands were divided into many small kingdoms. The legendary legacies of the Empire are hidden within these kingdoms. According to legends, the one who unites these legacies will restore the shattered Molgrad Empire to its former glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/8c87ffa210f31eeef5160cde53e86264.avif?t=1754046027\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each card affects enemies in specific positions. With certain special cards, you can randomly or selectively change the enemy's formation. This mechanic adds strategic depth to battles and allows you to make advantageous attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/ffc3d9a6c19026727db605a01a9070e4.poster.avif?t=1754046027\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/ffc3d9a6c19026727db605a01a9070e4.webm?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/extras/ffc3d9a6c19026727db605a01a9070e4.mp4?t=1754046027\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you only have cards that work with specific units and you don\u2019t have those units in your hand, some special cards allow you to swap your units and rebuilding the strategic balance. When used at the right moment, it can change the destiny of the battle.</p>","developers":["Virtual Fable"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2906660","name":"Conquer Lands"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723700/230405673fc52b843b042eebf96c7bade3ad485d/header.jpg?t=1754046027","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 (Big Sur) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any Intel or Apple Silicon processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257171058,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171058/movie480.mp4?t=1753801846","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171058/movie_max.mp4?t=1753801846"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257171058/6bc5ec175fcac18355963419f5d0896f7207865c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753801846","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171058/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1753801846","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257171058/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1753801846"}}],"name":"Conquer Lands Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz+ CPU with SSE4.1 support required<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 5000 or better, OpenGL Support required<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"